      "properties": {
        "reported": true,
        "property_type": "optical",
        "summary": "Solid-state visible/NIR luminescence of 5-Ln (including 5-Pr) is sensitized by 3-NO2Tp− ILCT antenna transitions (πPz→π*3-NO2Pz near 330–365 nm). Room-temperature excitation of the Pr analogue was recorded observing 611 nm emission. Higher nuclearity modulates Ln3+ vs ligand bands in excitation spectra via Ln–Ln energy transfer; 5-Pr does not follow the simple nuclearity trend seen for Eu.",
